{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33715","headline":"杜甫同谷茅茨 · 赵鸿","name":"杜甫同谷茅茨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"工部栖迟後，邻家大半无。\n青羌迷道路，白社寄杯盂。\n大雅何人继，全生此地孤。\n孤云飞鸟什，空勒旧山隅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵鸿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33715.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33715","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}